  "strategy": [
    "Add one new primary-role indicator to every headline/primary construct with fewer than two primary indicators.",
    "Use natural counter-keying where it improves response-style balance without manufacturing false opposites.",
    "Use vignettes, rankings, and paired tradeoffs for constructs that are poorly represented by ordinary agreement items.",
    "Keep all new item targets theoretical; no psychometric weights are embedded."
